{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15222010","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15222010","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1522201001:0":{"text":"Hey! You blind? Everyone's lining up. Get to the back!","source_cn":"喂，没看到大家都在排队吗？到后面去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECA83D6C4A723FDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1522201002:0":{"text":"I don't have time to stand around.","source_cn":"我赶时间，没空排队。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE42B131855173FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1522201003:0":{"text":"This is relief food! It's for people trying to survive! What makes you rich folk think you deserve it?","source_cn":"……这是赈灾粮，是救命的粮食！你们有钱人凭什么来领？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D44CFA99B975DDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1522201004:0":{"text":"Pfft. You think you're the only one who's lost something?","source_cn":"哼，呼临城里谁没受灾啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1B08E4ECA87E2B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1522201005:0":{"text":"If it's relief food, it ought to go to everyone. You don't get to just take it all for yourselves.","source_cn":"既然是赈灾粮，那就人人有份。凭什么让你们独占？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D8BE4C8F1A8CBC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1522201006:0":{"text":"Are you kidding me? Look around, half the city's waiting on this food to stay alive!","source_cn":"什么歪理！你没看见，这么多人都等着这口救命的粮食吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFE115ADC85FFFC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1522201007:1":{"text":"That's enough! Everybody back in line!","source_cn":"别吵了！都去排队！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92167700B5FBA192","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1522201008:1":{"text":"Oh, now you speak up? Where were you when he shoved his way to the front? Send him to the back!","source_cn":"他刚才大摇大摆插队的时候你怎么不说？你让他排到最后去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2D0F1AB1125A020","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1522201009:0":{"text":"Kalan again. Can't even keep order during a food handout.","source_cn":"又是卡利安那个没用的家伙，连这点破事都管不住！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC986A2641571502","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1522201010:0":{"text":"You lot, cut it out!","source_cn":"你们几个——别再吵了！","status":"matched","h